	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　Demon Lord’s Room'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki was sitting tensely in a'
	R
	'chair. Hornet was there as'
	R
	'well, as though to protect her.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you afraid?'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Of God’s army.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'...Yeah...'
	R
	'I’m afraid...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'...It’ll be okay...'
	R
	'I’ll protect you with my life.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'...B-But...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes?'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'...I... Um...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m not used to being treated'
	R
	'like this...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'When I was in Japan, I was'
	R
	'just a normal girl...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Nobody ever served me or'
	R
	'anything, so... When you say'
	R
	'stuff like that, Hornet... Um...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'It must feel like quite a'
	R
	'burden upon you.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'Well...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'But you needn’t think of it as'
	R
	'a burden.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'I don’t know what the world'
	R
	'you lived in was like, but...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'In this world,'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'it’s not unreasonable for you to'
	R
	'live a life where you are served'
	R
	'by all.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'O-Okay...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'...Ms. Miki...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re very important to this'
	R
	'world... Please resign'
	R
	'yourself to that...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'I don’t know about times of'
	R
	'peace, but right now we’re'
	R
	'fighting God.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Though not awakened, you are the'
	R
	'Demon Lord...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Make your power available for'
	R
	'whenever it’s needed from now'
	R
	'on.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'...Okay...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Ms. Miki...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes?'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'If we enter a time of peace...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Then we’ll be able to enjoy'
	R
	'talking about more girlish'
	R
	'things...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'...Okay...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki looked at Hornet’s gentle'
	R
	'smile and smiled herself.'
	\L_06dab:
