	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance was looking over his'
	R
	'shell collection when Maris'
	R
	'frantically ran up to him.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance...'
	R
	'Miki Kurusu left this behind'
	R
	'and left the castle.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris reported and handed'
	R
	'Rance a letter.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh!?'
	R
	'Miki left...?'
	R
	'Why...?'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance tore open the letter.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s it say...?'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'　To everyone in Leazas,'
	R
	'　I’m going to go look for'
	R
	' Kentarou.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'　I’ll manage, so please don’t'
	R
	'worry about me, everyone.'
	R
	'　Goodbye.           Miki.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t worry, she says...'
	R
	'She’s the Demon Lord...'
	R
	'Aren’t there demons after her?'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Also, what the fuck’s she'
	R
	'talking about!? Search for'
	R
	'Kentarou... He’s dead...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'It seems that Miki didn’t want'
	R
	'to accept that.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Kh...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06d58:
	!VAR0516 : 5!
	\L_06d4a:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'Darling, I don’t really mind'
	R
	'her being gone...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'She’s the Demon Lord, right?'
	R
	'She should be fine wandering'
	R
	'around out there.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s a problem, too!'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06d58:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_06d4a:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ve already begun a search,'
	R
	'but we haven’t found any sign'
	R
	'of her going anywhere...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Kh... Damn it...'
	R
	'Why did this happen...?'
	R
	'Shit... Stupid Miki...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Despite their desperate search,'
	R
	'they were unable to find'
	R
	'Miki’s whereabouts...'
