	\L_06cda:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'It was the runaway Demon Lord,'
	R
	'Miki Kurusu.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'She walked along the bank all'
	R
	'alone.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki plopped down on the'
	R
	'riverside.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'She stared into the streaming'
	R
	'river.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	!VAR0516 : 55!
	\L_06d4a:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah...!!'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06d58:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'She thought she saw Kentarou’s'
	R
	'face reflected in the river,'
	R
	'but it quickly disappeared.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Naturally.'
	R
	'Kentarou was dead.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Wah... Hick...'
	R
	'Ah... Aah...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Like a dam had burst open,'
	R
	'Miki began to cry.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'I can’t... do it... I can’t do'
	R
	'it... What should I do...? I'
	R
	'dunno...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Kentarou...'
	R
	'Kentarou...'
	R
	'Why did you die...?'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'We were gonna go back to Japan'
	R
	'together... You promised...'
	R
	'...Uu... Hick...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Liar...'
	R
	'You’re so mean...'
	R
	'Leaving me here all alone...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'What should I do...?'
	R
	'I dunno...'
	R
	'I dunno...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'I wanna go home... I just wanted'
	R
	'to go home... With you...'
	R
	'Kentarou...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Just then the light dimmed,'
	R
	'but Miki didn’t notice through'
	R
	'all her crying.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'...Huh...?'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki was suddenly assaulted by'
	R
	'a floating feeling.'
	R
	'She raised her head.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'...What...?'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Kyah...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Kyaaaah...!'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'A giant battleship hovered above'
	R
	'Miki’s head. It was firing a'
	R
	'tractor beam centered on her.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki was being sucked into the'
	R
	'gigantic battleship.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s going on...?'
	R
	'No... Someone help me...'
	R
	'I’m scared...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Kentarou... Help me...'
	R
	'Kentarou...!!'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Still not knowing what was'
	R
	'happening, Miki curled up,'
	R
	'stiffened,'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'and she was taken into the'
	R
	'battleship.'
