	ZH 1:
	'Just an ordinary little girl.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'So this is the Demon Lord...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'If this is how she is, I could'
	R
	'never bring myself to follow'
	R
	'her...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'The only woman that’s worth'
	R
	'anything is my sister, after'
