	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Mt. Salen'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　　Summit'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'After a lot of effort, Miki'
	R
	'and Kentarou finally made it'
	R
	'to the top of the mountain.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, the summit.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah, haah... haah...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you okay?'
	R
	'Take my hand...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Kentarou reached the summit'
	R
	'first and extended a hand out'
	R
	'to Miki.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Okay, Kentarou.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06d2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Kentarou grasped Miki’s hand'
	R
	'and pulled her up. There they'
	R
	'found a flower garden.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'In the middle of that garden'
	R
	'was a single tree.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s the hirami lemon tree.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'Kentarou picked off the single'
	R
	'ripe hirami lemon that was on'
	R
	'the tree.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Then he took out a'
	R
	'handkerchief and wiped it'
	R
	'clean.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'Here, Miki.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Thanks, Kentarou.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Munch...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'With just a little bite, she'
	R
	'felt power drain from her and'
	R
	'sat down on the ground.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you okay, Miki?'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah... I’m fine.'
	R
	'I just feel a little weak.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Also... Look!'
	R
	'My fangs disappeared, too...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06d2e:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki faced Kentarou and opened'
	R
	'her mouth wide.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'Stupid, that’s an improper'
	R
	'thing for a girl to do.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Uhuhu...'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'So, what now...?'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'What will we do, Kentarou?'
	R
	'Return to Leazas?'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'No, let’s not. We can’t really'
	R
	'trust King Rance.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Really?'
	R
	'I thought he was nice...'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'But if you say so, then let’s'
	R
	'not go back.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cf6:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah.'
	R
	'If we work together, we’ll'
	R
	'manage somehow.'
	\L_06dab:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki... I’ll definitely turn'
	R
	'you back to normal.'
	R
	'Then we’ll return to our world.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06c86:
	ZH 1:
	'Okay, Kentarou.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
	\L_06cbe:
	ZH 1:
	'They held hands and descended'
	R
	'the mountain.'
	\L_06dab:
	\L_06d9e:
